{"data":{"uuid":"bd13235d-1261-4b71-b32f-aed1a8beb526","slug":"cf-337-panther-repeater","name":"CF-337 Panther Repeater","class_name":"KLWE_LaserRepeater_S3","classification":"Ship.Weapon.Gun","classification_label":"Gun","description":{"en_EN":"The CF-337 Panther is the size three model in Klaus & Werner's laser repeater line. The Panther is a true fire-and-forget weapon with a respectable power consumption-to-damage ratio. Pilots who outfit their ships with Panthers rarely regret the decision.","de_DE":"Hersteller: Klaus & Werner\nTyp (En): Laser Repeater\nTyp (De): Laser-Repetierer\n\nGr\u00f6\u00dfe: S3\n\nDer CF-337 Panther ist das S3 Modell in Klaus & Werners Laser-Repetierer-Reihe. Der Panther ist eine echte Fire-and-Forget-Waffe mit einem respektablen Energieverbrauch-zu-Schaden-Verh\u00e4ltnis. Piloten, die ihre Schiffe mit Panthern ausstatten, bereuen diese Entscheidung selten.","zh_CN":"\u5236\u9020\u5546\uff1a\u514b\u52b3\u65af&\u97e6\u7eb3 (Klaus & Werner)\n\u7269\u54c1\u7c7b\u578b\uff1a\u6fc0\u5149\u901f\u5c04\u70ae\n\u5c3a\u5bf8\uff1a3\n\nCF-337\"\u9ed1\u8c79\"\u662f\u514b\u52b3\u65af&\u97e6\u7eb3\u6fc0\u5149\u901f\u5c04\u70ae\u4ea7\u54c1\u7ebf\u4e2d\u76843\u7ea7\u5c3a\u5bf8\u578b\u53f7\u3002\u201c\u9ed1\u8c79\u201d\u662f\u4e00\u95e8\u771f\u6b63\u7684\u201c\u53d1\u5c04\u540e\u4e0d\u7ba1\u201d\u6b66\u5668\uff0c\u62e5\u6709\u7740\u53ef\u89c2\u80fd\u8017-\u4f24\u5bb3\u8f6c\u5316\u7387\uff0c\u4f7f\u7528\u201c\u9ed1\u8c79\u201d\u6b66\u88c5\u81ea\u5df1\u98de\u8239\u7684\u9a7e\u9a76\u5458\u4eec\u4ece\u4e0d\u540e\u6094\u8fd9\u4e00\u51b3\u5b9a\u3002","fr_FR":"Type d'article : R\u00e9p\u00e9teur Laser\nFabricant : Klaus & Werner\nTaille : 3\n\nLe CF-337 Panther est le mod\u00e8le de taille trois dans la ligne de r\u00e9p\u00e9teurs laser de Klaus & Werner. Le Panther est une arme v\u00e9ritablement \u00e0 tir et oubli, avec un ratio consommation-d\u00e9g\u00e2ts respectable. Les pilotes qui \u00e9quipent leurs vaisseaux de Panthers regrettent rarement cette d\u